0 -15 Td (But then you open the Old Testament. You read about Adam and Eve. You read) Tj
0 -15 Td (about Noah and the ark. You read about Abraham and Isaac. You read about) Tj
0 -15 Td (Joseph and his brothers. You read about Moses and the Red Sea. You read about) Tj
0 -15 Td (David and Goliath. You read about Jonah and the big fish. You might wonder,) Tj
0 -15 Td ("What do these have to do with Jesus? What do they have to do with my new) Tj
0 -15 Td (life?") Tj
0 -15 Td () Tj
0 -15 Td () Tj
0 -15 Td (Here is the secret. They are shadows. They are not the real thing. They are) Tj
0 -15 Td (not the substance. They are shadows. They are previews. They are patterns.) Tj
0 -15 Td (They are clues. And every single one of them points to Jesus. They are the Old) Tj
0 -15 Td (Testament shadows. He is the New Testament reality.) Tj
0 -15 Td () Tj
0 -15 Td () Tj
0 -15 Td (This book is for you. You are new to the faith. You are building your) Tj
